    <briefdescription>
<para>An analysis pass which caches information about the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_function" kindref="compound">Function</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Records the function level information used by GCRoots. This pass depends on <computeroutput><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_collector_metadata_analysis" kindref="compound">CollectorMetadataAnalysis</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
